2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (A\040Predictive\040Maintenance\040Model\040for\040Flexible\040Manufacturing\040in\040the\040Context\040of\040Industry\0404\0560\056)
/Author (Go\040Muan\040Sang\054\040Lai\040Xu\054\040Paul\040de\040Vrieze)
/Subject (The\040Industry\0404\0560\040paradigm\040is\040the\040focus\040of\040modern\040manufacturing\040system\040design\056\040The\040integration\040of\040cutting\055edge\040technologies\040such\040as\040the\040Internet\040of\040things\054\040cyber\055physical\040systems\054\040big\040data\040analytics\054\040and\040cloud\040computing\040requires\040a\040flexible\040platform\040supporting\040the\040effective\040optimization\040of\040manufacturing\055related\040processes\054\040e\056g\056\054\040predictive\040maintenance\056\040Existing\040predictive\040maintenance\040studies\040generally\040focus\040on\040either\040a\040predictive\040model\040without\040considering\040the\040maintenance\040decisions\040or\040maintenance\040optimizations\040based\040on\040the\040degradation\040models\040of\040the\040known\040system\056\040To\040address\040this\054\040we\040propose\040PMMI\0404\0560\054\040a\040Predictive\040Maintenance\040Model\040for\040Industry\0404\0560\054\040which\040utilizes\040a\040newly\040proposed\040solution\040PMS4MMC\040for\040supporting\040an\040optimized\040maintenance\040schedule\040plan\040for\040multiple\040machine\040components\040driven\040by\040a\040data\055driven\040LSTM\040model\040for\040RUL\040\050remaining\040useful\040life\051\040estimation\056\040The\040effectiveness\040of\040the\040proposed\040solution\040is\040demonstrated\040using\040a\040real\055world\040industrial\040case\040with\040related\040data\056\040The\040results\040showed\040the\040validity\040and\040applicability\040of\040this\040work\056)
/Keywords (25\040Aug\0402021\054\040Predictive\040maintenance\054\040Industry\0404\0560\054\040Big\040data\054\040Schedule\054\040Bournemouth\040University)
>>
endobj
